  "term": "column",
  "definition": "A column is an anatomical grouping of nerve elements, especially fibers or tracts, that runs lengthwise within the central nervous system while keeping a fairly consistent position and structure. The term is used particularly for the longitudinal fiber groups seen in the spinal cord.",
